    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\binom{10}{6}\\times2=420$ ways.",
      "worked": "Choose six students. Each selection has two permitted arrangements: increasing height and decreasing height.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\binom{10}{6}\\times2\\\\N&=210\\times2\\\\N&=420.\\end{align*}$$",
